{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Bias Mitigation in AI.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Bias Mitigation in AI.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"bias mitigation in ai bias mitigation in ai","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Bias Mitigation in AI.md","fileName":"Bias Mitigation in AI.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Bias Mitigation in AI","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 23:09\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Algorithmic Fairness and Justice]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Algorithmic Fairness and Justice","Dataset Representativeness","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Bias Mitigation in AI.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Bias Mitigation in AI.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"bias mitigation in ai bias mitigation in ai","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Bias Mitigation in AI.md","fileName":"Bias Mitigation in AI.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Bias Mitigation in AI","heading":"Bias Mitigation in AI","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Bias mitigation in AI is the effort to identify and reduce unjust patterns in data, models, and deployment. Measures can include improving [[Dataset Representativeness]], examining labels and proxy variables, comparing outcomes across groups, changing objectives, diversifying teams, and monitoring a system after release.\n\nNo purely technical method can remove every contested value. Mitigation must begin with a definition of the relevant harm and a defensible account of fairness. It must also consider whether the application should exist at all; making a discriminatory system somewhat more balanced does not justify an illegitimate institutional use.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Algorithmic Fairness and Justice","Dataset Representativeness","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pa